/T (Founded in 2016 as Mechanism Design for Social Good \(MD4SG\), EAAMO has grown into a significant force within the academic and practitioner communities. EAAMO organizes interdisciplinary working groups, community events throughout the year, and since 2021, the annual ACM EAAMO conference. With over 3,000 members from 150 institutions across 50 countries, EAAMO is a truly global initiative. The organization is currently led by junior researchers from six continents, reflecting its diverse and inclusive ethos.)
/E (Founded in 2016 as Mechanism Design for Social Good \(MD4SG\), EAAMO has grown into a significant force within the academic and practitioner communities. EAAMO organizes interdisciplinary working groups, community events throughout the year, and since 2021, the annual ACM EAAMO conference. With over 3,000 members from 150 institutions across 50 countries, EAAMO is a truly global initiative. The organization is currently led by junior researchers from six continents, reflecting its diverse and inclusive ethos.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [0]
>>
