/E (Attendees can look forward to three days of presentations, discussions, poster sessions, and community-building activities that highlight cutting-edge work at the intersection of algorithms, optimization, mechanism design, and the social sciences. As in previous years, the conference will provide numerous opportunities for networking and collaboration, fostering connections among researchers, policymakers, nonprofit organizations, industry professionals, and community advocates from around the world. The event continues EAAMO's commitment to building a global community focused on ensuring that computational tools and technologies serve the public good and expand access to opportunity for historically underserved communities.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [2]
>>
