/T (Currently, the group is developing a syllabi evaluation rubric rooted in principles of algorithmic fairness, with plans to expand this framework across disciplines, including data science, responsible AI, public policy, and economics. As part of this effort, they are actively seeking syllabi from a wide range of courses, regardless of department or institution, and are welcoming new members who share their commitment to rethinking how STEM is taught.)
