700 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 331 0 R
/T (How can responsible AI principles be translated into real-world systems that support vulnerable populations? A recent collaboration between the Living Labs with Practitioners working group and Chayn, a global nonprofit supporting survivors of gender-based violence, offers a compelling set of examples of how AI can be designed, evaluated, and deployed in high-emotion, high-stakes contexts.)
/E (How can responsible AI principles be translated into real-world systems that support vulnerable populations? A recent collaboration between the Living Labs with Practitioners working group and Chayn, a global nonprofit supporting survivors of gender-based violence, offers a compelling set of examples of how AI can be designed, evaluated, and deployed in high-emotion, high-stakes contexts.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
701 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 331 0 R
/T (Highlights include From Hopes to Healing Systems: Listening at Scale to Survivor Voices in Gender-Based Violence Recovery, presented at APPAM 2025, which explores how LLM-based classification and topic modeling can help organizations better understand survivor perspectives on healing expressed across online platforms. The work demonstrates how AI can support large-scale listening and analysis while preserving the nuance and complexity of lived experience.)
/E (Highlights include From Hopes to Healing Systems: Listening at Scale to Survivor Voices in Gender-Based Violence Recovery, presented at APPAM 2025, which explores how LLM-based classification and topic modeling can help organizations better understand survivor perspectives on healing expressed across online platforms. The work demonstrates how AI can support large-scale listening and analysis while preserving the nuance and complexity of lived experience.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [2 945 0 R 4]
>>
endobj
702 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Span
/K [3]
/Pg 30 0 R
/P 945 0 R
>>
endobj
703 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 331 0 R
/T (The collaboration also supported the launch of Survivor AI, a GenAI tool that assists survivors of image-based sexual abuse in drafting takedown requests. Developed with a strong focus on safety, agency, and care, the tool illustrates how responsible AI principles can be embedded directly into products intended to support individuals navigating difficult and emotionally charged situations.)
/E (The collaboration also supported the launch of Survivor AI, a GenAI tool that assists survivors of image-based sexual abuse in drafting takedown requests. Developed with a strong focus on safety, agency, and care, the tool illustrates how responsible AI principles can be embedded directly into products intended to support individuals navigating difficult and emotionally charged situations.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [5 946 0 R 7]
>>
endobj
