/T (Complementing this work, Safety is a Process, Not a Score, presented at the AAAI 2025 Fall Symposium, introduces a symbol-aware, sociotechnical methodology for evaluating AI safety in social-good applications. The paper describes participatory testing approaches involving survivors and community allies, proposes new ways of assessing safety beyond benchmark scores, and is accompanied by a public Transparency Hub that documents the ongoing evaluation of Survivor AI.)
/E (Complementing this work, Safety is a Process, Not a Score, presented at the AAAI 2025 Fall Symposium, introduces a symbol-aware, sociotechnical methodology for evaluating AI safety in social-good applications. The paper describes participatory testing approaches involving survivors and community allies, proposes new ways of assessing safety beyond benchmark scores, and is accompanied by a public Transparency Hub that documents the ongoing evaluation of Survivor AI.)
