/Title (Highlights include From Hopes to Healing Systems: Listening at Scale to Survivor Voices in Gender-Based Violence Recovery, presented at APPAM 2025, which explores how LLM-based classification and topic modeling can help organizations better understand survivor perspectives on healing expressed across online platforms. The work demonstrates how AI can support large-scale listening and analysis while preserving the nuance and complexity of lived experience.)
